{"seq":5,"slug":"carnet-compliance-audit-metrics","title":"单证册合规审计、整改与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ata-carnet-temporary-admission/carnet-misuse-samples/carnet-compliance-audit-metrics","wordCount":3014,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"单证册合规审计-整改与度量\">单证册合规审计、整改与度量</h1><p>单证册的风险不在签发那一刻，而在册子交回出证机构之前的每一次口岸作业里。审计要回答的不是笼统的&quot;这本册子合不合规&quot;，而是三个能被证据支持的问题：签注链在哪里断了、断口对应多少应缴税费、同一个断口在下一次出境前是否被真正关掉。把这三件事化成可复算的指标，是这套制度里唯一能把&quot;运气好没被查&quot;变成&quot;结构性不出错&quot;的路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-审计对象是签注链-不是货物\">核心概念：审计对象是签注链，不是货物</h2><p>普通报关的合规审计盯的是单据与实货是否一致；单证册的审计对象更窄也更硬——盯的是<strong>每一张被撕走的进口凭证（importation voucher）能否在册上找到一张与之配对的复出口签注</strong>。货物&quot;看起来回来了&quot;不算数，只有目的国海关在复出口凭证与存根（counterfoil）上盖的那枚章才算数。因此审计的输入不是货物照片或物流轨迹，而是签注事件的集合：每跨越一次关境就产生一条记录（国别、口岸、方向、凭证号、存根号、签章日期），闭合判定退化成一次配对查询。签注缺口是<strong>随时间扩张</strong>的缺陷——今天缺的复出口签注，明天可能因海关补章而自愈，也可能因越过有效期而固化成索赔。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[单证册签发&lt;br/&gt;自签发日起 1 年有效] --&gt; B[境外每次进/出口&lt;br/&gt;凭证被撕走 + 存根盖章]&#10;  B --&gt; C{每张进口凭证&lt;br/&gt;是否有配对复出口签注}&#10;  C --&gt;|有| D[签注闭合&lt;br/&gt;该段风险归零]&#10;  C --&gt;|无| E[签注缺口&lt;br/&gt;进入违规分类与定价]&#10;  E --&gt; F[逾期未复运 / 册下销售&lt;br/&gt;复运未签章 / 消费方式结关]&#10;  F --&gt; G[出证机构核销&lt;br/&gt;索赔或保证金处置]&#10;  G --&gt; H[整改:补证 / 转 TIB / 换册 / 缴税]&#10;  H --&gt; I[度量:闭合率 / 梯度暴露 / 押金释放周期]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[单证册签发&lt;br/&gt;自签发日起 1 年有效] --&gt; B[境外每次进/出口&lt;br/&gt;凭证被撕走 + 存根盖章]\n  B --&gt; C{每张进口凭证&lt;br/&gt;是否有配对复出口签注}\n  C --&gt;|有| D[签注闭合&lt;br/&gt;该段风险归零]\n  C --&gt;|无| E[签注缺口&lt;br/&gt;进入违规分类与定价]\n  E --&gt; F[逾期未复运 / 册下销售&lt;br/&gt;复运未签章 / 消费方式结关]\n  F --&gt; G[出证机构核销&lt;br/&gt;索赔或保证金处置]\n  G --&gt; H[整改:补证 / 转 TIB / 换册 / 缴税]\n  H --&gt; I[度量:闭合率 / 梯度暴露 / 押金释放周期]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><p>审计范围用一张三层表固定下来。三层缺一层结论就不可用：只看签注层会漏掉&quot;货物其实被卖了&quot;这类实体违规，只看实体层又会漏掉电子单证册时代新增的&quot;电子签注未回传&quot;缺陷。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审计层</th>\n<th>判定问题</th>\n<th>关键证据</th>\n<th>度量口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签注层</td>\n<td>每个进口段是否有配对复出口签章</td>\n<td>存根、凭证、黄凭证复进口签章</td>\n<td>签注闭合率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体层</td>\n<td>货物是否原状、是否被销售或消耗</td>\n<td>总清单、海关查验记录、销售税票</td>\n<td>违规类型分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务层</td>\n<td>保证金是否可释放、索赔是否已了结</td>\n<td>缴税凭证、往来函件、TIB 单</td>\n<td>押金锁定天数、索赔金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"违规分类与金额阶梯\">违规分类与金额阶梯</h2><p>违规不是同一种东西，混在一张&quot;待办清单&quot;里会导致整改动作错配。以美国对外国单证册的口径为准，可拆出四类高频非合规，每类都有独立的触发证据与定价（<a href=\"https://www.uscib.org/ata-carnet-faqs/\">USCIB ATA Carnet FAQs</a>，2026）。</p>\n<p><strong>逾期未复运。</strong> 触发证据是&quot;复出口签注缺失 + 已过有效期&quot;。美方给出三级阶梯：90 天以内按应缴关税的 25%，91 至 180 天按 50%，181 天及以上按全额，三档均另加 10% 罚金，前两档最低收费分别为 50 美元与 100 美元。计税基数是&quot;关税加进口环节代征内地税&quot;而非货值，高税率品类的罚金远高于直觉估算。</p>\n<p><strong>册下货物被销售。</strong> 单证册只覆盖&quot;非为销售&quot;的货物，一旦成交即须缴税，<strong>并加收该税额 10% 的罚金</strong>，另计发证方的索赔处理费。在境外完税的持证人应取得载明品名、金额与单证册号的<strong>逐项海关收据</strong>，再把原件连同收据寄回签发方并保留副本。</p>\n<p><strong>复运未取得签章。</strong> 若复运只能提供境外证明（落地证书、运单或提单）而无海关签章，后续索赔可能产生 <strong>100 美元补正规费</strong>；若单证册由第三国签章、或到期前已复运回本国，另收 <strong>50 美元规费</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>以消费方式结关。</strong> 外国单证册不能被消费报关单冲销，否则可能造成<strong>双重税负</strong>；正确路径是在届满前通过报关行申报 <strong>TIB（Temporary Importation under Bond，保税暂时进口）</strong>，TIB 须引用单证册号，描述、重量、价值与总清单一致。另有<strong>提前处置</strong>减免通道：货物确定不复运时，可在届满前申请 <strong>anticipatory breach（预期违约）</strong>，向美国海关入境团队提交持证人抬头的函件并请求裁量损害赔偿，附封面、总清单与已验证的进口存根副本，凭带案号的缴款收据注销所列货项；JFK 机场不受理过期前的申请。</p>\n<p>（数据来源：<a href=\"https://www.uscib.org/ata-carnet-faqs/\">USCIB ATA Carnet FAQs</a> 关于外国单证册在美过期、册下销售、复运未签章与消费结关的口径，2026 年。）</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计证据链与底稿要素\">审计证据链与底稿要素</h2><p>底稿的第一原则在制度条文里已经写明：单证册是发证方的财产，须在&quot;最后一次使用后、或立即到期时（以先到者为准）&quot;交回；<strong>交回前须保留整套册子的清晰副本，含已用与未用的存根与凭证</strong>——这份复印件是原件寄出后唯一能自证的材料。可用于索赔抗辩的底稿至少要能证明四件事：签注链全貌（完整复印件）、册下货物已完税（含单证册号与金额的逐项海关收据）、监管方式转换的时点（TIB 申请表与保税凭证）、交回义务与索赔是否了结（未交回通知、挂号邮寄凭证、往来函件与缴款收据）。</p>\n<p>底稿的时间属性同样要落进字段。财务侧必须区分三个日期：<strong>货物复运日、核销完成日、保证金可释放日</strong>。三者在单证册路径上并不同步——海关当局可在到期后 <strong>1 年内</strong>向 NGA 主张税费，NGA 责任上限为应缴税费的 <strong>110%</strong>；押金释放更晚，未交回的册子持续 open，要到<strong>到期后 13 个月</strong>且无人索赔时才释放（<a href=\"https://www.uscib.org/ata-carnet-faqs/\">USCIB FAQ</a>；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ATA_Carnet\">Wikipedia: ATA Carnet</a>）。押金与索赔条款见同章<a href=\"../carnet-application-guarantee/carnet-guarantee-deposit-claim\">《单证册的担保、保证金与索赔追偿》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量指标体系\">度量指标体系</h2><p>度量不是把违规数量加总，而是把&quot;暴露&quot;换算成可与财务口径对话的量。<strong>签注闭合率</strong>衡量流程健康度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>matched</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>import</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{N_{\\text{matched}}}{N_{\\text{import}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4365em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">import</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">matched</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 低于 100% 不等于违规——可能只是签注尚未回传——但它是最灵敏的先行指标，因为每个未闭合段都在向索赔方向累积暴露。<strong>逾期梯度暴露</strong>把逾期时长映射成金额：设应缴关税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、进口环节代征内地税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，逾期档位折扣系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与最低收费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0.25,\\ 50)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0.50,\\ 100)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.00</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1.00,\\ 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则该段罚金为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i = \\max\\Big(m_i,\\ (\\alpha_i + 0.10)\\cdot (D + T)\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>规费暴露</strong>按缺陷形态取值：仅凭境外证明 100 美元，第三国签章或到期前已回国 50 美元。<strong>押金锁定周期</strong>用日历天数而非状态词表达：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>lock</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>release</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>expiry</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{lock}} = T_{\\text{release}} - T_{\\text{expiry}} \\approx 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 个月（无索赔时）——把它纳入现金流预测，才能解释为什么&quot;货物早就回来了&quot;和&quot;钱回来了&quot;是两件事。</p>\n<p>eATA 正在改变这些指标的采集方式。据世界海关组织公布的时间表，欧盟 27 国与挪威、瑞士、英国已于 <strong>2026 年 6 月 1 日</strong>激活电子 ATA 单证册，阿联酋为 <strong>2026 年 11 月 9 日</strong>；二维码数字申报不可用时纸质单证册仍被接受，过渡期持续到 <strong>2027 年 12 月 31 日</strong>，全球全面数字化预期在 <strong>2028 年 1 月 1 日</strong>完成（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/facilitation/instrument-and-tools/conventions/pf_ata_system_conven.aspx\">WCO: ATA System</a>）。两点直接含义：其一，交易码与二维码取代纸质签章作为过境凭据，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>matched</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{matched}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">matched</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的来源从人工录入变为接口回传；其二，eATA 系统<strong>独立于目的国报关系统</strong>且使用 App 需要联网，底稿里应同时留存二维码截图或 PDF。数字化并不消解交回义务——电子册用毕仍须通知服务商，若同时签发纸质版，纸质册仍须邮寄交回。## 整改闭环与预防性控制</p>\n<p>整改的价值在于把一次索赔转成一条控制：逾期走&quot;缴税结案或先期转 TIB&quot;，销售走&quot;取得逐项收据并按发票补税&quot;，未签章走&quot;补证并在索赔中接受规费&quot;，消费结关则退回 TIB 路径重做。判定顺序是先问货物是否已复运（是则补签章证据、接受 100 或 50 美元规费），再看是否已过期（未过期走预期违约或转 TIB，已过期按梯度缴税结案），最后交回册子与完整副本，由签注链是否闭合决定核销还是索赔。共同预防手段是把动作前移到有效期之内：TIB 与预期违约都必须在<strong>过期前</strong>申报，续签单证册应至少在到期<strong>30 天前</strong>联系签发方，且并非所有国家都接受续签册，可行性要在申办阶段就核实。追加凭证组收费 <strong>25 美元/组、80 美元起</strong>（另加运费），提前备足比临时追加便宜。</p>\n<p>把整改沉淀成常态控制，关键是让预警锚定在<strong>可计算日期</strong>上，并按控制项、触发条件与留痕三列落表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制项</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>留痕</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有效期预警</td>\n<td>到期前 60 天</td>\n<td>回程计划与订舱记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签注对完整性</td>\n<td>每次口岸作业后</td>\n<td>存根/凭证扫描件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凭证余量核查</td>\n<td>每一次使用后</td>\n<td>剩余凭证组数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换册可行性确认</td>\n<td>到期前 30 天</td>\n<td>书面确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>押金释放跟踪</td>\n<td>到期后第 1–13 个月</td>\n<td>交回凭证与索赔查询记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>技术侧还有一个跨过渡期的硬约束：纸质签注录入路径与 eATA 电子签注接口必须<strong>并行维护</strong>，两条路径的核销判定最终要收敛到同一个配对查询上。国际商会提供 24 小时技术支持渠道（support.atacarnet.iccwbo.org），但签发机构仍是第一联系人。货物的准入范围是否成立，决定了整条审计链的前提，其判定见<a href=\"../temporary-admission-scope/eligible-goods-classification-criteria\">《准入货物的分类判定标准》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单证册审计的对象是<strong>签注链</strong>：每张进口凭证能否找到配对的复出口签章，是全部结论的起点；本国文件不能替代对方海关的签章。</li>\n<li>违规分四类分别处置：逾期未复运、册下销售、复运未签章、消费方式结关。逾期罚则呈递进阶梯：美方口径为 90 天内 25%、91–180 天 50%、181 天以上全额，均另加 10% 罚金，前两档最低 50/100 美元；销售另加税额 10% 罚金；复运未签章的规费为 100 或 50 美元。</li>\n<li>时间上必须区分<strong>货物复运日、核销完成日、押金可释放日</strong>：无索赔时押金在到期后 <strong>13 个月</strong>释放，NGA 赔付上限为应缴税费的 <strong>110%</strong>，海关主张时限为到期后 <strong>1 年</strong>。</li>\n<li>度量用四个可复算指标：签注闭合率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、逾期梯度暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、规费暴露、押金锁定周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>lock</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{lock}} \\approx 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 个月。eATA 下闭合判定的数据来源从人工录入转为接口回传，过渡期至 <strong>2027 年 12 月 31 日</strong>，须同时维护纸质与电子两条判定路径。</li>\n<li>整改沉淀为控制项：到期前 60 天预警、每次作业后校验签注对、到期后启动释放倒计时；追加凭证组为 25 美元/组、80 美元起。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：本文依据公开的 USCIB、ICC/WCF 与 WCO 公约资料整理，法规依据为《ATA 公约》（1961）与《伊斯坦布尔公约》（1990，Annex A 的 ATA 单证册附约）；截至 2026-10 未检索到上述审计、罚则与规费规则的废止或替代性修订。逾期梯度、规费与凭证组价格以属地发证/担保机构的当期口径为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单证册合规审计、整改与度量","id":"单证册合规审计-整改与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：审计对象是签注链，不是货物","id":"核心概念-审计对象是签注链-不是货物"},{"level":2,"text":"违规分类与金额阶梯","id":"违规分类与金额阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"审计证据链与底稿要素","id":"审计证据链与底稿要素"},{"level":2,"text":"度量指标体系","id":"度量指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"违规调查取证与处罚处置实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ata-carnet-temporary-admission/carnet-misuse-samples/misuse-investigation-penalty-handling"},"next":null}